<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<mdclass:Constant xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:core="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/mcore" xmlns:mdclass="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/metadata/mdclass" uuid="0f6cd283-96a7-4964-8c65-5e791977813b">
  <producedTypes>
    <managerType typeId="af6847f6-1b96-486c-bca9-8369cb34a609" valueTypeId="95c39a2f-5c22-443a-b7e1-a79167347253"/>
    <valueManagerType typeId="28b2b69f-9da4-4d24-9f00-cb19905847f2" valueTypeId="6ea70f01-0f6f-41da-abcc-7109ec39f01c"/>
    <valueKeyType typeId="b8fa53aa-b8c4-5307-b366-16863658f918" valueTypeId="b67757cb-aed5-55b9-9bd0-c8e1ac9b0451"/>
  </producedTypes>
  <name>UseSummaryAccountingOfLowQualityGoods</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Use summary accounting of low-quality goods</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>استفاده از حسابداری خلاصه کالاهای کم‌کیفیت</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Utilizzare contabilità generalizzata degli articoli scadenti</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Używaj uogólnionej ewidencji towarów niskiej jakości</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Использовать обобщенный учет некачественных товаров</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Standart altı ürünlerin genelleştirilmiş muhasebesini kullan</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Sử dụng kế toán tổng quát của hàng hóa bị lỗi</value>
  </synonym>
  <type>
    <types>Boolean</types>
  </type>
  <useStandardCommands>true</useStandardCommands>
  <explanation>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>If the option is enabled, then goods with quality other than &quot;New&quot; can be linked to several quality goods.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>در صورت فعال بودن این گزینه، کالاهایی با کیفیت غیر از &quot;نو&quot; را می‌توان به چند کالای باکیفیت پیوند داد.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Se l'opzione è abilitata, le merci di qualità, diverse dal &quot;Nuovo&quot;, si può associare con alcuni merci di qualità</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Jeśli ta opcja jest włączona, wiersze pozycji o jakości innej niż &quot;Nowa&quot; mogą być powiązane z kilkoma produktami o wysokiej jakości.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Если опция включена, до товары с качеством, отличным от &quot;Новый&quot; можно связывать с несколькими качественными товарами.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Bu seçenek etkinleştirilirse, &quot;Yeni&quot; dışında bir niteliğe sahip ürünler birkaç nitelikli ürünle ilişkilendirilebilir.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Nếu bật tùy chọn thì hàng hóa có chất lượng khác với &quot;Mới&quot; có thể liên quan với nhiều hàng hóa chất lượng khác.</value>
  </explanation>
  <minValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
  <maxValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
  <choiceHistoryOnInput>DontUse</choiceHistoryOnInput>
  <dataLockControlMode>Managed</dataLockControlMode>
</mdclass:Constant>
